About Stillness
Our Vision
We will give every child a safe environment and the opportunity to embrace their strengths; those that they may already know of, and those that they will discover when they thrive through our broad and creative curriculum.
Stillness children develop shared values of respect, confidence and leadership and in partnership with our families, are nurtured to become responsible citizens of tomorrow.
Our children are offered opportunities of leadership as:
We take great pride in ensuring that the excellent behaviour of our children is rooted in their happiness in school. We nurture curiosity and creativity through an inspiring, broad and engaging curriculum, where learning is at the heart of all that we do. Our children learn to become resilient and self-assured in an environment where safety is outstanding. Everyone is challenged and encouraged to thrive and achieve as individuals, preparing them for their role as caring and active citizens in modern Britain.
It is our aim for all children to leave here as independent learners with self-belief and an abiding respect for others.
‘Pupils said that they feel safe and happy in school. Leaders act on any safeguarding concerns quickly.’
